Answer: Message center and mobile.

M365 Admin center&gt;Health&gt;Message center - contains an Inbox of messages with information about upcoming and past updates; You can filter for:
Service (M365 apps, Exchange Online, Bookings, etc.);
Status for your org (Launched, Rolling out, Scheduled, Changed within last week, Changed within last month);
Platform (iOS, Linux, Web, Desktop, Mac, Mobile);
Message state (Favorites, Unread, Updated);
Relevance (High, Medium, Low);
Tag (Admin impact, Data privacy, Feature update, Major update, New feature, Retirement, user impact).

M365 Admin mobile app&gt;Health&gt;Message center - similar to the online Health&gt;Message center, but less filters (only has Tag, Message state, and Service).

It is answered backwards. It should be;
